Medium was also defeated, but only by one of three attempts. The harness has reached hard (`n=6`), where the intended exact route is 298 XORs—just inside the cap—and the certificate is still only 230 characters.
diff --git a/gen_2005_13305.py b/gen_2005_13305.py
