    44	# The profile is a property of the FAMILY, not of an instance, so it is computed once
    45	# from a shipping-preset instance and stamped identically onto every record.  A
    46	# failure here is reported, never swallowed: `core_provenance` would silently read
    47	# "derived" and the release would look measured when it is not.
    48	try:
